### 4. Report Issue → Open Support Ticket

#### [MODIFY] `support.service.ts`
Add missing user-facing methods (the existing service only covers admin endpoints):
- `openTicket(payload)` → `POST /api/admin/support/tickets/open-ticket`

#### [NEW] `report-issue-modal.component.ts/.html/.scss`
A modal component (similar to `ReviewModalComponent`) with:
- Ticket type selector (Technical / Booking / Payment / General)
- Priority selector (Low / Medium / High / Critical)
- Description textarea
- Submit → calls `supportService.openTicket()`
- Toast on success

#### [MODIFY] `my-bookings.component.ts`
- Import `ReportIssueModalComponent`
- `reportIssue(bk)` → opens modal, passing the booking reference
- `closeReportModal()` handler

#### [MODIFY] `my-bookings.component.html`
- Wire `"Report an Issue"` button to open the modal
- Add `<app-report-issue-modal>` to template

